# exchange.pdl - Exchange HQ settings (edit them in the Settings tab of the window; plan: @.apps/pet-trainer/CHAIN-ECONOMY-DESIGN.md section 11). `SECTION | key | value   # comment`
# Preferred value = the old chain's cones (final, 100% confirmed). Every other unit is averaged into preferred value by its real trades here.
FEE   | percent        | 2        # fee on every trade, paid in preferred cones (or auto-exchanged into preferred at the averaged rate)
RATE  | window_trades  | 20       # the averaged rate = volume-weighted price of the last N trades of that unit
RATE  | band_pct       | 50       # a trade priced more than this % away from the current average is refused (one trade cannot move the rate far)
RATE  | floor_bp       | 10       # lowest allowed average, in basis points of preferred per unit (10000 = 1:1)
RATE  | ceiling_bp     | 1000000  # highest allowed average
UNIT  | cones | Preferred cones (old chain) | 10000
UNIT  | mined | Mined cones (pet-cones)     | 500
UNIT  | play  | Play money (paper)          | 100
